  "name": "Chicken Pasanda",
  "subtitle": "Creamy almond chicken curry with warm spices",
  "description": "Yogurt-marinated chicken thighs simmer with onions, aromatics, spices, almond milk, and cream, then finish with coriander and toasted almonds.",
